{
  "mark.15.p1.b1": {
    "text": "夜が明けるとすぐ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p1.b2": {
    "text": "祭司長たちは長老、律法学者たち、および全議会と協議をこらした末、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p1.b3": {
    "text": "イエスを縛って引き出し、ピラトに渡した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p2.b1": {
    "text": "あなたがユダヤ人の王であるか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p2.b2": {
    "text": "そのとおりである",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p2.b3": {
    "text": "何も答えないのか。見よ、あなたに対してあんなにまで次々に訴えているではないか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p2.b4": {
    "text": "しかし、イエスはピラトが不思議に思うほどに、もう何もお答えにならなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p3.b1": {
    "text": "さて、祭のたびごとに、ピラトは人々が願い出る囚人ひとりを、ゆるしてやることにしていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p3.b2": {
    "text": "ここに、暴動を起し人殺しをしてつながれていた暴徒の中に、バラバという者がいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p3.b3": {
    "text": "おまえたちはユダヤ人の王をゆるしてもらいたいのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p4.b1": {
    "text": "それでは、おまえたちがユダヤ人の王と呼んでいるあの人は、どうしたらよいか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p4.b2": {
    "text": "十字架につけよ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p4.b3": {
    "text": "あの人は、いったい、どんな悪事をしたのか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p4.b4": {
    "text": "十字架につけよ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p5.b1": {
    "text": "それで、ピラトは群衆を満足させようと思って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p5.b2": {
    "text": "バラバをゆるしてやり、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p5.b3": {
    "text": "イエスをむち打ったのち、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p5.b4": {
    "text": "十字架につけるために引きわたした。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p6.b1": {
    "text": "兵士たちはイエスを、邸宅、すなわち総督官邸の内に連れて行き、全部隊を呼び集めた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p6.b2": {
    "text": "いばらの冠を編んでかぶらせ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p6.b3": {
    "text": "ユダヤ人の王、ばんざい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p6.b4": {
    "text": "また、葦の棒でその頭をたたき、つばきをかけ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p7.b1": {
    "text": "こうして、イエスを嘲弄したあげく、紫の衣をはぎとり、元の上着を着せた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p7.b2": {
    "text": "それから、彼らはイエスを十字架につけるために引き出した。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p7.b3": {
    "text": "そこへ、…シモンというクレネ人が、郊外からきて通りかかったので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p7.b4": {
    "text": "人々はイエスの十字架を無理に負わせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p8.b1": {
    "text": "そしてイエスをゴルゴタ、その意味は、されこうべ、という所に連れて行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p8.b2": {
    "text": "そしてイエスに、没薬をまぜたぶどう酒をさし出したが、お受けにならなかった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p8.b3": {
    "text": "それから、イエスを十字架につけた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p8.b4": {
    "text": "そしてくじを引いて、だれが何を取るかを定めたうえ、イエスの着物を分けた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p9.b1": {
    "text": "イエスを十字架につけたのは、朝の九時ごろであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p9.b2": {
    "text": "イエスの罪状書きには「ユダヤ人の王」と、しるしてあった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p9.b3": {
    "text": "また、イエスと共にふたりの強盗を、ひとりを右に、ひとりを左に、十字架につけた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p10.b1": {
    "text": "ああ、神殿を打ちこわして三日のうちに建てる者よ、十字架からおりてきて自分を救え",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:29-30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p10.b2": {
    "text": "他人を救ったが、自分自身を救うことができない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p10.b3": {
    "text": "イスラエルの王キリスト、いま十字架からおりてみるがよい。それを見たら信じよう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p10.b4": {
    "text": "また、一緒に十字架につけられた者たちも、イエスをののしった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p11.b1": {
    "text": "昼の十二時になると、全地は暗くなって、三時に及んだ。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p11.b2": {
    "text": "そして三時に、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p11.b3": {
    "text": "エロイ、エロイ、ラマ、サバクタニ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p11.b4": {
    "text": "それは「わが神、わが神、どうしてわたしをお見捨てになったのですか」という意味である。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p12.b1": {
    "text": "そら、エリヤを呼んでいる",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p12.b2": {
    "text": "待て、エリヤが彼をおろしに来るかどうか、見ていよう",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p12.b3": {
    "text": "イエスは声高く叫んで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p12.b4": {
    "text": "ついに息をひきとられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p13.b1": {
    "text": "そのとき、神殿の幕が上から下まで真二つに裂けた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p13.b2": {
    "text": "イエスにむかって立っていた百卒長は、このようにして息をひきとられたのを見て",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p13.b3": {
    "text": "まことに、この人は神の子であった",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p14.b1": {
    "text": "また、遠くの方から見ている女たちもいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p14.b2": {
    "text": "その中には、マグダラのマリヤ、小ヤコブとヨセとの母マリヤ、またサロメがいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p14.b3": {
    "text": "彼らはイエスがガリラヤにおられたとき、そのあとに従って仕えた女たちであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p14.b4": {
    "text": "なおそのほか、イエスと共にエルサレムに上ってきた多くの女たちもいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p15.b1": {
    "text": "さて、すでに夕がたになったが、その日は準備の日、すなわち安息日の前日であったので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p15.b2": {
    "text": "アリマタヤのヨセフが…彼は地位の高い議員であって、彼自身、神の国を待ち望んでいる人であった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p15.b3": {
    "text": "大胆にもピラトの所へ行き、イエスのからだの引取りかたを願った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p15.b4": {
    "text": "ピラトは、イエスがもはや死んでしまったのかと不審に思い、百卒長を呼んで、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p16.b1": {
    "text": "そこで、ヨセフは亜麻布を買い求め、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p16.b2": {
    "text": "イエスをとりおろして、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p16.b3": {
    "text": "その亜麻布に包み、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p16.b4": {
    "text": "墓の入口に石をころがしておいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:46"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p17.b1": {
    "text": "マグダラのマリヤとヨセの母マリヤとは、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.15.p17.b2": {
    "text": "イエスが納められた場所を見とどけた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 15:47"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
